    "content": "Operators can be written in any order",
    "rationale": "The order is fixed by the postfix form."
   },
   {
    "key": "C",
    "content": "It can be evaluated without any memory",
    "rationale": "A stack is needed."
   },
   {
    "key": "D",
    "content": "No brackets or precedence rules are needed when the expression is evaluated",
    "correct": true,
    "rationale": "Correct."
   }
  ],
  "explanation": "The order of evaluation is built into the order of the tokens.",
